OL,3,GNEWSAWe had an absolute ball - Peters'
OL,4,Afarewell to Hull
OL,5,
OL,6,FHull Kingston Rovers' most successful
OL,7,Fcoach Willie Peters admits "there's
OL,8,Fbeen tears" as his family prepare to
OL,9,Fbid an emotional farewell to East
OL,10,FYorkshire.
OL,12,FThe 47-year-old Australian is returning
OL,13,Fhome with his wife, Kera, and two sons
OL,14,Fhaving enjoyed an "instant connection"
OL,15,Fwith locals after bringing a period of
OL,16,Funprecedented success during his four
OL,17,Fyears at the rugby league club.
OL,19,F"Hull gets a negative rap with people
OL,20,Fwho aren't from here, they call it all
OL,21,Fsorts of names," he said.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
