OL,3,GNEWSAWe had an absolute ball - Peters'
OL,4,Afarewell to Hull
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Once you come and understand what the
OL,7,Fcity is about, what the people are
OL,8,Fabout and get an appreciation of what
OL,9,Fthis city is truly about, you're going
OL,10,Fto miss that."
